B.VN=new A.a6(B.eT,["p001","1","My Village","My village is a small and peaceful place surrounded by green fields and tall trees. Every morning the farmers wake up early and go to their land with their oxen. Children walk together to the nearby school, carrying their bags and laughing along the way. In the evening the whole village gathers near the old well to talk about the day. Life here is simple, but people are kind and always ready to help each other in times of need."],t.w)
B.VJ=new A.a6(B.eT,["p002","1","The Value of Time","Time is one of the most valuable gifts that Allah has given us. Once a moment passes, it can never come back, no matter how much we wish for it. A wise student plans his day carefully and gives proper time to study, rest and play. He does not waste hours on useless things. Those who respect time always move ahead in life, while those who ignore it are left behind with regret."],t.w)
B.VK=new A.a6(B.eT,["p003","2","Importance of Education","Education is the key that opens the door to progress for every nation. It teaches a person how to think clearly, speak confidently and act responsibly. An educated youth can find better work, support his family and serve his country in many ways. In the modern age, knowledge of technology has become as important as reading and writing. Therefore, every parent should make sure that their children receive a good education without any discrimination."],t.w)
B.VM=new A.a6(B.eT,["p004","2","Environmental Protection","Our environment is under serious threat because of pollution, deforestation and the careless use of natural resources. Smoke from factories and vehicles makes the air unhealthy, while plastic waste damages rivers and soil. Planting more trees, saving water and reducing waste are small steps that every citizen can take. If we protect nature today, the coming generations will be able to live in a clean, healthy and beautiful world."],t.w)
B.VO=new A.a6(B.eT,["p005","1","The Joy of Reading","Reading is one of the best habits a child can have. A good book takes us to new places, teaches us new words and makes our mind strong. When we read every day, our spelling gets better and our thoughts become clear. Many great people spent long hours with books in their childhood. A small library at home or in school can change the life of a whole family. So let us read at least one page every day and enjoy it."],t.w)
B.VL=new A.a6(B.eT,["p006","2","Honesty is the Best Policy","Honesty is the best policy in every part of life. An honest person speaks the truth even when it is hard, and people trust him with their money and their secrets. A dishonest trader may earn more for a short time, but he soon loses his customers. In school, an honest student does not copy in the exam and is proud of every mark he earns. Honesty gives peace to the heart, and peace is worth more than all the wealth in the world."],t.w)
